WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.903
- So here, are you feeling anything now?

00:00:01.903 --> 00:00:04.614
- Yeah, it's crazy, when I
look out into the audience

00:00:04.614 --> 00:00:06.860
all I see in here is dead people.

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:07.960
I feel like I'm connecting.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.380
- Oh my God, it's the
the movie "Sixth Sense"

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:11.213
you're that boy.

00:00:11.213 --> 00:00:13.530
- It is, I feel like I'm
connecting with the funeral home

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.400
because all of these souls that are here,

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.180
you know trying to speak
and trying to connect

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:19.490
and first of all your mom's departum?

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:20.710
Your mom's sitting right next to you,

00:00:20.710 --> 00:00:21.543
can I get up?

00:00:21.543 --> 00:00:22.590
- What, what?

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:23.940
- Your mother's right here.

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:27.400
The way that it works for me
is that when I'm in a room

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:29.820
or I'm in an area, all
of your souls are trying

00:00:29.820 --> 00:00:31.290
to come through and speak
and she was just sitting

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:32.797
next to you and saying,
"That's my daughter,

00:00:32.797 --> 00:00:33.780
"that's my daughter."

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.440
So know it's your mom's
way of just acknowledging

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:37.780
that you're here and letting
you know that she is okay.

00:00:37.780 --> 00:00:40.040
This was a woman who had
suffered before her passing

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:40.894
here in the physical world.

00:00:40.894 --> 00:00:41.727
- Yes.

00:00:41.727 --> 00:00:43.330
- 'Cause what happens is Kelly,
is that they'll put me back

00:00:43.330 --> 00:00:45.290
in their body to show me what had gone on,

00:00:45.290 --> 00:00:46.767
and they'll stand next to
you to show you they're here

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:48.300
and she showed me she couldn't breathe

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:49.247
before she had passed.

00:00:49.247 --> 00:00:51.026
- Yes, she was put on a ventilator.

00:00:51.026 --> 00:00:53.420
- I feel like I'm drowning,

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.790
but I'm connected to her.
- What?

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:58.797
- Yeah, she had a heart attack,
I was in the emergency room,

00:00:58.797 --> 00:01:01.270
she was 62 years old.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:02.550
- [Kelly] That's young.
- Your mom says to me,

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:04.300
that first of all she want's
to thank you for keeping

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:06.390
a promise to her, she
says you promised to her

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.770
that you weren't gonna leave
her side 'cause she was afraid,

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:09.907
she says, "And do you
know that my daughter

00:01:09.907 --> 00:01:11.360
"stayed with me all night long."

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:13.470
And you laid on the side
of her and laid with her

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:15.860
and your mom just wants
to say, thank you so much

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.660
for allowing my soul to go the other side.

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:18.493
- Yeah.

00:01:18.493 --> 00:01:19.724
- Can I give you a hug?

00:01:19.724 --> 00:01:20.557
- Yeah.

00:01:20.557 --> 00:01:23.222
(audience clapping)

00:01:23.222 --> 00:01:27.180
- She also says, when
I'm connecting with her

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:28.844
that you feel her all the
time, 'cause she shows

00:01:28.844 --> 00:01:30.400
me that she's in the house with you

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:31.410
and you talk with her

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:33.410
and you mom says, "I hear
everything that you do."

00:01:33.410 --> 00:01:34.957
She says, "So, thank
you for laying with me,

00:01:34.957 --> 00:01:36.177
"staying with me and making

00:01:36.177 --> 00:01:38.490
"my journey to the other side okay."

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:40.620
She says, "'Cause I couldn't
have done it without you."

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:42.302
She say, "And thank you
for respecting my wishes."

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:43.940
Right, give her a round of applause.

00:01:43.940 --> 00:01:44.773
- Wow.

00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:46.543
(audience applause)

00:01:46.543 --> 00:01:47.950
So wait I have a question.

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:48.830
- Yes.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.870
- I mean, so wait you can come over here,

00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:52.940
'cause I want to ask you this,
because you just brought up

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.380
the journey afterwards, right?

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.587
So do a lot of people ask
you, sorry I'll wait for you

00:01:57.587 --> 00:02:00.040
to sit down, but wait, oh I'm so sorry.

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:00.873
- Oh that's okay.

00:02:00.873 --> 00:02:03.760
- Do a lot of people ask you
what happens after people

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:05.650
pass, after they die?

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:07.802
Or I will, what happens?

00:02:07.802 --> 00:02:08.929
(laughs)

00:02:08.929 --> 00:02:10.330
I don't know if others do
but do you, I mean 'cause

00:02:11.373 --> 00:02:12.270
if you see them, what do you
think happens when we die?

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:14.320
- So what happens is is
that when you first pass on,

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:17.150
'cause I read for a lot of
people and their loved ones

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:18.394
will come through and tell
me what happens afterwards

00:02:18.394 --> 00:02:20.560
and when you first pass
on and when you first go

00:02:20.560 --> 00:02:23.070
the other side, you're
immediately greeted by family

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:25.170
members that had passed,
family members, pets,

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:26.579
people that had passed
on, they're all there,

00:02:26.579 --> 00:02:28.541
it's literally like one big family reunion

00:02:28.541 --> 00:02:30.130
on the other side.

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:32.720
- Okay, well thank you for
doing, that was incredible

00:02:32.720 --> 00:02:33.553
and I am

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:36.570
mind blown.

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:37.405
(audience clapping)

00:02:37.405 --> 00:02:38.520
That you even knew all those details

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:40.610
is so creepy and awesome,

00:02:40.610 --> 00:02:43.180
I am so glad I don't
see dead people though

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:44.687
so please dead people
if you're in the room,

00:02:44.687 --> 00:02:46.863
I can't handle it,

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:49.143
just so you know.

